{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年43歲的李彩華（Rain）近年主攻內地市場，工作不斷的她賺到盤滿缽滿，吸金力驚人，有傳她現時持有12個物業，身家早已超過2億，是圈中名副其實的隱形小富婆！一向不吝嗇大曬Fit爆身材的李彩華，近日趁工作空檔飛往泰國曼谷度假，並在社交平台連環曬出多張火辣街拍及打卡照！</p><figure><img alt=\"生日快樂！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202002940236140544817569.jpeg/cTiNusNUN6s8r3dX5ulS64hDGx-DikZ287J74vOye-I\"/><figcaption>生日快樂！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生日快樂！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202002960889417728256730.jpeg/z84Z9H7zydIvL5cB4GjSfJRPb3Ei1R3imd3JMJndyTA\"/><figcaption>生日快樂！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"隱形小富婆！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251111/1064920501304168448569801.jpeg/Uzr9s1Eip6eVNRdeGtIegA0F8t43J7pvXJRDwFyUQ8A\"/><figcaption>隱形小富婆！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得極好！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196868062331277312873194.jpeg/MSiVkXYOpFvM2DScOcqv4W5EL5CaANN-wWyyDsFssg4\"/><figcaption>Keep得極好！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>李彩華Y2K雙孖辮造型超吸睛　俯身澎湃上圍呼之欲出極震撼</p><p>相中所見，李彩華紮起一頭金啡色長孖辮，戴上型格黑超，身穿鮮黃色配紅白波點內襯的針織比堅尼，下身搭配黑色蕾絲邊牛仔熱褲，大騷零贅肉纖腰及馬甲線，造型充滿Y2K少女感。當中一張坐住低頭玩手機的照片中，李彩華微微向前俯身，澎湃上圍呼之欲出，畫面極吸睛！李彩華亦現身曼谷潮流熱點Thonglor（通羅）街頭留影，大騷白滑逆天長腿！</p><figure><img alt=\"大騷零贅肉纖腰及馬甲線！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202002958787940352138450.jpeg/A7FUPuJn8A6w1aw8l5S2WfMCkr4whlLYSArbtEgK27Q\"/><figcaption>大騷零贅肉纖腰及馬甲線！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"澎湃上圍呼之欲出！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202002956493524992519806.jpeg/0rhBMgrIC2chwcQ2vuBQ7D0RHaOhVlT9XFlc_lxZXP4\"/><figcaption>澎湃上圍呼之欲出！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大騷白滑長腿！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202002954215886848205984.jpeg/VYFe1XJn0Dhks72OHXP-s_LdImssY9-IPXAlXj1wJV4\"/><figcaption>大騷白滑長腿！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"打卡照。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261124/1202002951934054400934507.jpeg/YZAa6Z4AQDUgbZVtz9FCjrOnHAdIiJfBUNAweVDQMHk\"/><figcaption>打卡照。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>曾代父還債傳坐擁12個物業　棄奢華名牌着Crocs拖鞋反差感十足</p><p>早年以玉女歌手身份入行的李彩華，當年因父親生意失敗欠下債務，她要「代父還債」，曾被上門追數，一度上繳所有收入，承受還債的巨大壓力，她又自爆曾被前老闆提出「陪客旅行」，因拒絕「潛規則」而遭雪藏，其後在老闆娘幫助下，賠了200多萬解約金「贖身」。對於有傳持有12個物業，遍佈香港、澳洲、英國、泰國等地，李彩華就坦言從未計算過，並指買樓是為了「老咗嘅時候，唔使再辛苦地工作」，而生財有道的她經常大曬名牌手袋及服飾，當中就有不少Hermès收藏，更不乏超難買的限量版，但今次她就一改以往奢華行頭，穿上一對綠色厚底Crocs拖鞋，以舒適貼地的打扮遊走曼谷街頭！</p><figure><img alt=\"43歲生日。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196868064634081280501967.jpeg/ZIfjQCqaMPliUNSADkgIntQh2SRcf7ou3tFGwt7RRsI\"/><figcaption>43歲生日。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"性感！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260226/1103750068231868416761920.jpeg/3bAnSuB4wGiVmJ1bEkm1hHk3tWF0L5Bc61LuwutS7sI\"/><figcaption>性感！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李彩華有不少Hermès手袋。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260226/1103751776051400704510927.jpeg/oBw56Kbws_rElEh28Pyydzakj_w_bDMbUfkrIFH5KyA\"/><figcaption>李彩華有不少Hermès手袋。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"勁！（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260226/1103751418302435328763549.jpeg/QW4CWgU97nUTiO5JsUy9-ZWrPXOXab82skcKULJHClA\"/><figcaption>勁！（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Hermès Constance Mini採用珍稀的原色蜥蜴皮。（IG@rainli1111）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260409/1118955645262368768947283.jpeg/0rj5Qz9HMyACK2WsiqaKgKa3Es3gIlvZhSmLPYUpiz0\"/><figcaption>Hermès Constance Mini採用珍稀的原色蜥蜴皮。（IG@rainli1111）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"李彩華獲Hermès驚喜慶生。（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261110/1196868056878419968706235.png/MXvYjJglt2fPcMR5jTq9DcJsbDey3yI-YgY2yGIGNsg\"/><figcaption>李彩華獲Hermès驚喜慶生。（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T07:22:38.708813+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":933,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T07:00:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T07:56:33.194330+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T07:16:02.570018+00:00","content_hash":"6cc4780747eb3415576a413805e4b8e6436863d56cf6d13926c6db71ee1de4af","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}